14
00:00:40,236 --> 00:00:43,456
Don't repeat yourself, write DRY code.

15
00:00:43,921 --> 00:00:46,116
That's something you will hear a lot and DRY

16
00:00:46,388 --> 00:00:49,192
code simply means code where you don't

17
00:00:49,208 --> 00:00:49,961
repeat yourself.

18
00:00:50,634 --> 00:00:53,838
And this is not a complex concept at all. It

19
00:00:53,838 --> 00:00:54,703
simply means

20
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:58,773
don't write the same code or very similar

21
00:00:58,821 --> 00:01:01,016
